<view class="page"><view class="eyebrow">每一段变化，都有记录</view><view class="title">{{node===1?'星火传感趋势':'龙芯系统趋势'}}</view><view class="filters"><view class="filter {{node===1?'active':''}}" data-node="1" bindtap="selectNode">星火传感</view><view class="filter {{node===2?'active':''}}" data-node="2" bindtap="selectNode">龙芯系统</view></view><view class="filters"><view wx:for="{{metrics}}" wx:key="key" class="filter {{metric===item.key?'active':''}}" data-metric="{{item.key}}" bindtap="selectMetric">{{item.label}}</view></view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="notice error">{{error}}</view><view class="card"><view class="row"><text>已上传的有效读数</text><text class="sub">{{unit}}</text></view><metric-chart points="{{points}}" node="{{node}}" field="{{metric}}" unit="{{unit}}"/><view class="sub">空白处表示没有有效读数或上传中断。</view><view wx:if="{{metric==='vibration'}}" class="sub spaced">每点是近 1 秒有效采样中的振动峰值。接近 0 表示加速度幅值接近静止状态；数值越大，偏离越明显。</view></view><view class="filters"><view class="filter {{minutes===1?'active':''}}" data-minutes="1" bindtap="selectTime">最近 1 分钟</view><view class="filter {{minutes===10?'active':''}}" data-minutes="10" bindtap="selectTime">最近 10 分钟</view></view><view class="footer-note">此处显示云端收到的摘要，最多最新 600 个点。原始六轴波形仍保存在设备本地；无法用云端摘要确定冲击或跌落细节。</view></view>
